  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Adding the two integrals, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mi>α</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>α</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />As,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> takes integral values only at discrete points,<br />Hence,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>π</mi></math>"
  }
}